{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51377","headline":"砥柱 · 柳公权","name":"砥柱","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"禹凿锋鈚後，巍峨直至今。\n孤峰浮水面，一柱钉波心。\n顶压三门险，根随九曲深。\n拄天形突兀，逐浪势浮沉。\n岸向秋涛射，祠斑夜涨侵。\n喷香龙上下，刷羽鸟登临。\n只有尖迎日，曾无柱影阴。\n旧碑文字在，遗事可追寻。\n（《古今图书集成·山川典》三九《底柱山部》（《记纂渊海》卷二十四收此诗「顶压三门险」以下四句，题作《题砥柱山》。\n「拄天」作「撑天」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳公权","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51377.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51377","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}